{"id":"P066-2","subject":"P","unit":"P066","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P066-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음이 기술하는 내용에 대한 장치는?\n\n  송수전단의 전압이 일정하게 유지되도록 조정역할을\n\n  하며, 역률을 개선하는 역할을 하면서 송전손실을\n\n  경감시켜 전력계통 안정도 향상에 기여한다.\n\n\n\n① 계기설비       ② 조상설비\n\n③ 급수설비       ④ 유압설비\n\n⑤ 공압설비","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":678},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n총 설비 부하가 150kW, 수용률 80, 역률이 80인\n수용가에 전력을 공급하는 변압기의 용량kVA은?\n\n\n① 120         ② 130\n\n③ 150         ④ 180\n\n⑤ 200","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n보호계전기에 대한 설명이 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 과전류 계전기  : 일정 전류 이상이 흐르면 동작\n\n② 유도형 계전기  : 아라고의 원판원리를 응용한 것\n\n③ 가동철편형 계전기  : 교류, 직류 모두 사용가능\n\n④ 가동코일형 계전기  : 가동코일을 회전시키는 것으로\n\n  교류에만 사용가능\n\n⑤ 지락 계전기  : 지락사고시 지락 검출용","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":642},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n다음 중 저압용 차단기로 사용하는 것은?\n\n\n① 진공 차단기      ② 공기 차단기\n\n③ 가스 차단기      ④ 유입 차단기\n\n⑤ 기중 차단기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n다음이 기술하는 내용에 해당하는 배전방식은?\n\n  동일 간선에 접속된 2대 이상의 변압기의 저압측\n\n  간선을 상호 병렬 접속하여 부하의 융통성을 구성한\n\n  배전방식\n\n\n① 수지식 (tree system)\n\n② 뱅킹식 (banking system)\n\n③ 환상식 (loop system)\n\n④ 계단식 (cascade system)\n\n⑤ 망상식 (network system)","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":786},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1454}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n개회로 제어계에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 오차를 교정할 수 있도록 구성된다.\n\n② 정확성이 높아진다.\n\n③ 구조가 간단하며 설치비가 비교적 저렴하다.\n\n④ 궤환회로를 갖는다.\n\n⑤ 구조가 복잡하며 설치비용이 고가이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":534},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":428},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m31-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1078}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n다음의 함수 에 대한 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n\n\n\n                            \n①       ②   \n                          \n③       ④   \n          \n⑤   ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":938},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":806},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m32-e2.webp","width":678,"height":662}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n\n다음 블록선도에 대한 전달함수      는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①            ②    \n\n                \n③            ④  \n   \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":944},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":610}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n\n다음 신호흐름선도에 대한 전달함수      는?\n\n\n\n\n\n   \n①\n      \n   \n②\n      \n   \n③\n      \n     \n④\n   \n     \n⑤\n   ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":1160},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":613}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n과도응답의 시간 특성에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 지연시간은 응답이 최초로 목푯값의 30가 되는데\n\n  요하는 시간이다.\n\n② 상승시간은 응답이 목푯값의 10부터 90데 도달\n\n  하는데 요하는 시간이다.\n\n③ 응답시간은 응답이 백분율 이내의 오차에 정작되는데\n\n  요하는 시간이다.\n\n④ 감쇠비(damping ratio)는 최대 오버슈트가 제2오버슈트\n\n  로 감소되는 비율이다.\n\n⑤ 최대 오버슈트는 응답이 목푯값을 초과하여 나타나는\n\n  최대편차량이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":722},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n                             \n폐루프 전달함수가          인 제어계를 제동      \n\n비()를 기준으로 해석한 내용으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 과제동이므로 진동없이 천천히 목푯값에 도달한다.\n\n② 임계제동이므로 진동없이 빠르게 목푯값에 도달한다.\n\n③ 제동비가 음수이므로 불안정한 제어계이다.\n\n④ 무제동으로 진동의 감쇠없이 무한이 진동이 발생한다.\n\n⑤ 부족제동으로 진동이 있으나 감쇠하여 목푯값에 도달\n\n  한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":719},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1516}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n                                   \n개루프 전달함수가              일 때,       \n이득여유(gain margin)는?\n\n①             ②           log             log\n③             ④           log             log\n⑤             log","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":648},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":366}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n                             \n선형 제어계의 폐루프 전달함수가         \n일 때, 제어계의 안정도를 판별하면?\n\n\n① 불안정        ② 안정\n\n③ 조건부 안정      ④ 임계안정\n\n⑤ 판별불가","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":516},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":643}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n근궤적에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 근궤적은 실수축에 대해 대칭이다.\n\n② 근궤적의 도착점은 영점에 해당한다.\n\n③ 근궤적의 점근선은 실수축에서 교차한다.\n\n④ 근궤적의 출발점은 극점이다.\n\n⑤ 근궤적의 가짓수는 극점개수와 영점개수 중에서 작은\n\n  개수와 동일하다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":591},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":784}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n\n             표현되는 상태방정식에서로\n       ,  일 때, 특성방정식은?\n                \n\n\n①       ② \n③       ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":595},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m40-e1.webp","width":696,"height":456}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n다음의 회로에서 전류 A는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                       \n①            ②       \n\n                       \n③            ④       \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m41-q.webp","width":696,"height":697},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":457}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n다음과 같은 회로에 sinV의 전압을\n\n인가할 때, 회로에 흐르는 전류의 실횻값A은?\n\n\n\n\n\n                          \n①            ②  \n\n                          \n③            ④  \n\n      \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":1025},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":826}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n다음과 같은 회로의 유효전력W은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 10          ② 12\n\n③ 14          ④ 16\n\n⑤ 18","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e25-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":857},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e25-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":600}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P066-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.11.30 SR (차량전기) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n다음과 같은 3상 회